\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Invariant channels and published composites}
\date{2026-11-21}

\p{The [vector channel](fdip-012V), the
[orbit-label channel](fdip-012V), and the
[plaquette channel](fdip-012V) are functions on the
finite configuration space. \ref{fdip-011J} compares squared
scalar norms, field-strength composites, and path pairings in a
cited compact model. The finite correlations of
\ref{fdip-012W} are sums over the eigenvectors of a finite
symmetric matrix, under the eigenbasis hypothesis recorded
there.}
